{"v":4,"catch":"用盡一切手段突破前線！","desc":"《Land Sea Air Squad》是TAITO於1986年推出的動作遊戲。\n在這款基於舞台的遊戲中，玩家將控制中士 Sarge，他必須使用手榴彈、機槍甚至車輛衝破每一個障礙物，這是 1986 年視訊螢幕上最逼真的戰鬥！\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2025-03-27","genres":["動作","街機"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/14ebabca4533acb8f9c9b20cf4b2d34ce35b17b8d5dfcfce3ca1ce17cae7bd1f.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/d79474b4b9c20818538ec4083870e627c9326b1a6572b031f65246dc5b520bf8.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/7880868495fa448d5133b996b0a5e7756febd44b1f3fa01a640ac681e82b7cde.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/0ced070be31ae50b15a2b187ca2b5e235322b28d8807c01da8dad7fd319fafb7.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/bd22ab21359d904af15c20e9047e4aedbbf29b97b0fd9b2e95126b3f1b82776b.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/2578d455f9a9d0fd8c8790fcd47780e47c97040b8a829a19671e64bf848f6b1e.jpg"],"titleId":"0100c04022482000","dlc":[]}